			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): Rebuild Target artifacts and update RouteManifest timestamp\n\nRecompile all ESBuild output bundles in `Target/` after the preceding Mountain gRPC integration and architecture-diagram refactor, synchronizing the compiled JS with the refreshed source.\n\nUpdate `Source/Generated/RouteManifest.ts` generation timestamp from `2026-05-19T04:08:18Z` to `2026-05-19T04:25:35Z`. The 19 compiled target files (JS bundles + source maps across Bootstrap, Effect, gRPC, Service, and Handler layers) remain byte-identical in size, confirming no source-level changes occurred between rebuilds.\n\nThis keeps the build pipeline consistent and the manifest aligned with the latest compilation cycle.",
			"SHA": "7d8b9aaa73ff85751d7e0292f67d51d41bbc65d5"
		},
